{"version":1,"content":"<p>BBC報道，白宮發言人扎卡里亞（Katie Zacharia）即將卸任職務。</p><p>她上任僅5天，成為白宮發言人任期最短紀錄。</p><p>報道指，美國白宮證實扎卡里亞會調離職務，但未有進一步交代時間細節。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T01:39:18.029785+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T01:23:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T12:37:37.887942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T01:37:37.644016+00:00","content_hash":"a5358ced764eb03d9404f187dd0cbca3e59b9789527f30f1d9111e3adbf35a6d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}